{"id":"bbddaeec1a020d3b","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-borel-space.md","title":"Borel Space","display":"df-borel-space — Borel Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-borel-space","aliases":["58-df-borel-space"],"display":"df-borel-space — Borel Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-topology]]","[[58-df-borel]]","[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-borel-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-borel-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-borel-space — Borel Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> (sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_X,\\tau_Y\">\\(\\tau_X,\\tau_Y\\)</span> (topologies on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_X=\\sigma_X(\\tau_X)\">\\(\\mathcal B_X=\\sigma_X(\\tau_X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_Y=\\sigma_Y(\\tau_Y)\">\\(\\mathcal B_Y=\\sigma_Y(\\tau_Y)\\)</span> (generated Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebras, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}\\)</span> (topology predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S\\)</span> (Borel-space predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelMap}_S\\)</span> (Borel-measurable-map predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}borel-space} \\vdash \\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal B_X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_X,X)\\land\\mathcal B_X=\\sigma_X(\\tau_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}borel-space} \\vdash \\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal B_X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_X,X)\\land\\mathcal B_X=\\sigma_X(\\tau_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}borel\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{BorelMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal B_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal B_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal B_X)\\land\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal B_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B_Y\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\mathcal B_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}borel\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{BorelMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal B_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal B_Y)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal B_X)\\land\\mathrm{BorelSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal B_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B_Y\\;(f^{-1}[B]\\in\\mathcal B_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Borel 空间是带有 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数的可测结构</li>\n<li>任何拓扑空间都自然诱导一个 Borel 空间</li>\n<li>A Borel map is measurable between the two displayed Borel measurable spaces; their topology and generated sigma-algebra data are explicit arguments.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}\">\\(\\mathbb{R}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^{\\omega}\">\\(\\omega^{\\omega}\\)</span> (Baire 空间) 是标准的 Polish Borel 空间</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-borel","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-borel]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a7